@page "/refund-policy"

<PageTitle>Refund Policy | Journey Recreated</PageTitle>

<div class="legal-page">

    <div class="legal-header">
        <p class="legal-eyebrow">Journey Recreated</p>

        <h1>Refund Policy</h1>

        <p class="legal-effective-date">
            Effective Date: October 2, 2026
        </p>
    </div>


    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>Introduction</h2>

        <p>
            Journey Recreated is owned and operated by
            <strong>Mr. Recreated LLC</strong>.
        </p>

        <p>
            Thank you for choosing Journey Recreated. We want you to
            have a positive experience with our service and appreciate
            the opportunity to serve you.
        </p>

        <p>
            Because Journey Recreated provides access to digital
            services and content, the following refund policy applies
            to purchases made through Journey Recreated.
        </p>
    </section>


    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>1. Refund Eligibility</h2>

        <p>
            Customers may request a refund within
            <strong>3 calendar days of the original purchase date</strong>.
        </p>

        <p>
            To be eligible for a refund, your request must be submitted
            within this 3-day period.
        </p>

        <p>
            Requests submitted after the 3-day refund period may not be
            eligible for a refund except where otherwise required by
            applicable law.
        </p>
    </section>


    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>2. How to Request a Refund</h2>

        <p>
            To request a refund, please contact us by email at:
        </p>

        <p>
            <a href="mailto:support@journeyrecreated.com">
                support@journeyrecreated.com
            </a>
        </p>

        <p>
            Please include sufficient information for us to identify
            your purchase, such as:
        </p>

        <ul>
            <li>Your name</li>
            <li>
                The email address associated with your
                Journey Recreated account
            </li>
            <li>The approximate date of purchase</li>
            <li>A brief explanation of your refund request</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
            We may request additional information when reasonably
            necessary to locate or verify the transaction.
        </p>
    </section>


    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>3. Approved Refunds</h2>

        <p>
            If your refund request is approved, the refund will generally
            be issued to the original payment method used for the purchase.
        </p>

        <p>
            The amount of time required for the refund to appear in your
            account may depend on your bank, card issuer, payment processor,
            or other financial institution.
        </p>
    </section>


    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>4. Purchases Outside the Refund Period</h2>

        <p>
            Refund requests submitted more than 3 calendar days after the
            original purchase date are generally not eligible for a refund.
        </p>

        <p>
            However, <strong>Mr. Recreated LLC</strong> may review
            exceptional circumstances on a case-by-case basis.
        </p>

        <p>
            Any discretionary refund provided outside the standard refund
            period does not create an obligation to provide similar refunds
            in the future.
        </p>

        <p>
            Nothing in this policy limits any rights or remedies that may
            be available to you under applicable law.
        </p>
    </section>


    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>5. Account Access Following a Refund</h2>

        <p>
            When a purchase is refunded, access to paid Journey Recreated
            services, features, or content associated with that purchase
            may be discontinued.
        </p>

        <p>
            In certain circumstances, Mr. Recreated LLC may choose to
            allow continued access after a refund at its discretion.
            Continued access following a refund does not create an
            obligation to provide the same treatment in future cases.
        </p>
    </section>


    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>6. Payment Processing</h2>

        <p>
            Payments and refunds may be processed through third-party
            payment processors.
        </p>

        <p>
            Journey Recreated and Mr. Recreated LLC are not responsible
            for delays caused by a customer's financial institution or
            payment provider after a refund has been properly submitted
            for processing.
        </p>
    </section>


    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>7. Changes to This Policy</h2>

        <p>
            Mr. Recreated LLC reserves the right to update or modify this
            Refund Policy from time to time.
        </p>

        <p>
            Any changes will be posted with an updated effective date.
        </p>

        <p>
            The refund policy in effect at the time of the applicable
            purchase will generally govern that purchase, subject to
            applicable law.
        </p>
    </section>


    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>8. Contact Us</h2>

        <p>
            If you have questions regarding this Refund Policy or would
            like to request a refund, please contact:
        </p>

        <div class="legal-contact-card">
            <strong>Mr. Recreated LLC</strong>

            <span>Journey Recreated</span>

            <a href="mailto:support@journeyrecreated.com">
                support@journeyrecreated.com
            </a>
        </div>

        <p>
            We appreciate your support of Journey Recreated and will make
            reasonable efforts to address refund requests with kindness,
            fairness, and care.
        </p>
    </section>


    <div class="legal-footer-links">
        <a href="/privacy-policy">
            Privacy Policy
        </a>

        <span aria-hidden="true">•</span>

        <a href="/terms">
            Terms &amp; Conditions
        </a>
    </div>

</div>